    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄοπλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without heavy armour on</i> (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλίτης</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.9
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <i>unarmed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				321c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τυφλὰ τοῦ σώματος καὶ ἄοπλα
				καὶ ἄχειρα,</span> i.e. the back, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρμα ἄ.</span> a chariot
				<i>without scythes,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.4.16
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνοπλος.</span></div>
